DM: Um,

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.160
DM: something seems to have changed since you left Tokra.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:26.220
DM: In the past, these dreams are rare, maybe a few times a year, but now every night takes you to a new landscape.

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:29.640
DM: Some of them are familiar from your childhood.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:35.180
DM: A lush forest, in autumn, leaves turning golden, high peaks surrounding you.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:40.900
DM: An island in the middle of an ocean with nothing but a single dark, tall tower standing on it.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:48.339
DM: A tall, green hill, perfectly round, with small white flowers growing on it, surrounded by desert.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.900
DM: Others are new and just flashes quicker than you can keep track of.

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:59.280
DM: A boat racked by waves, s- un- surprisingly to you, ma- seemingly made of stone.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:05.080
DM: An impossible castle floating in the air above an expansive patchwork of small farms and cities.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:09.080
DM: A vast, endless, expansive forest as far as the eye can see.

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:11.440
DM: But there's one that keeps returning night after night.

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:17.800
DM: A red sandstone mesa in a rocky desert, a small, clear oasis sheltering in the shadow of its cliffs.

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:19.060
Kenzo: Say that one again.

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:27.100
DM: A l- a red sandstone mesa in the, in a rocky desert, a small, clear oasis sheltering in the shadow of its cliffs.

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:37.760
DM: As you approach Karawa, the first thing you see from a distance in the morning light is a red sandstone mesa standing above the rocky desert ground.

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:46.820
DM: The desert flowers grow thickly here, scrubby, thorny plants bursting in color in the late spring before the heat of summer dries up the ground.

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:53.180
DM: But you hardly notice as your steps slow, then stop, and you realize that you are staring at an image out of your dreams.

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:58.380
DM: A temple is carved into the side of the mesa, and extends from it.

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:03.039
DM: The oasis is enclosed in a stone pool and surrounded by swaying palms.

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:13.040
DM: There's a small village that seems to have sprung up around, of mud houses and narrow streets, punctured by a few larger buildings and a large sandstone plaza.

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:16.320
DM: All of this has grown up from the desert of your dreams.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:21.660
DM: A bustling tavern caravan saray stands on the outskirts of town.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:27.800
DM: But take away the buildings, and the scene in front of you is unmistakably one you have seen many times over the past week of travel.

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:40.180
DM: Unsure of what it might mean, but drawn by an immediate connection to this place that seems at once deeply familiar and completely new, you start to head down in towards town,

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:45.080
