02:21:21.244 --> 02:21:21.764
Unknown: [laughs]

02:21:21.764 --> 02:21:24.704
Seeker: [laughs] I'm just looking at sedimenta- sedimentary layers,

02:21:25.764 --> 02:21:25.984
Unknown: you know?

02:21:27.244 --> 02:21:28.224
