Unknown: [laughs] Hmm.

02:24:16.784 --> 02:24:19.464
Seeker: And then d- and deposit it f- up to five feet away.

02:24:21.464 --> 02:24:21.704
Unknown: Um-

02:24:21.704 --> 02:24:22.004
Unknown: Because-

02:24:22.004 --> 02:24:25.964
DM: You can only... If it's, it's on- You can only excavate it, though, if it's loose earth.

02:24:25.964 --> 02:24:34.514
