02:24:34.514 --> 02:24:34.524
Unknown: [laughs]

02:24:34.524 --> 02:24:35.744
Seeker: Hmm.

02:24:35.744 --> 02:24:36.523
Seeker: Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.

02:24:36.523 --> 02:24:39.104
DM: Create a staircase.

02:24:39.104 --> 02:24:43.344
