02:25:56.584 --> 02:25:56.614
Unknown: Yeah.

02:25:56.614 --> 02:25:57.504
DM: I'm sure he does.

02:25:57.504 --> 02:25:59.124
DM: He, yeah, you make it.

02:25:59.124 --> 02:25:59.224
Unknown: Um.

02:25:59.224 --> 02:25:59.544
Unknown: All right.

02:26:02.504 --> 02:26:06.344
