02:29:24.608 --> 02:29:25.868
Wellby: Yeah.

02:29:25.868 --> 02:29:27.328
DM: Um, you haven't...

02:29:27.328 --> 02:29:28.558
DM: I mean, that is, it is,

02:29:30.108 --> 02:29:32.048
